{"id":438,"title":"解答: 寻找两数和为n","summary":"给出4种不同的解法，逐一分析不同解法的复杂度。","tags":"","components":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"7162ddab-3a53-4c7f-9d7d-46b46a8a905b","text":"## 解法1：暴力查询","text_html":"<h2>解法1：暴力查询</h2>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":0},{"type":"TabbedCode","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"3861e6f7-a2e7-4424-9d08-e831be020147","caption":"","code_contents":[{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"tab_code_0_3861e6f7-a2e7-4424-9d08-e831be020147","title":"find_sum","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"def find_sum(lst, n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Function to find two number that add up to n\n    :param lst: A list of integers\n    :param n: The integer number n\n    \"\"\"\n\n    for i in range(len(lst)):\n        for j in range(len(lst)):\n            if lst[i] + lst[j] == n and i != j:\n                return [lst[i], lst[j]]\n\n\n# Driver code to test above\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    \n    print(find_sum([1, 2, 3, 4], 5))\n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null}],"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"191b6f24-da92-4085-8f43-8bb457909f5c","text":"### 解释\n\n这是最耗时且也最直观的算法。遍历整个列表，对于列表中的每个数字，检查是否有另一个数字相加和为给定的数字`n`。\n\n因此，使用嵌套的`for`循环，对整个列表中的每个数字进行遍历迭代。\n\n### 时间复杂度\n\n由于在整个$n$元素的列表上进行了嵌套迭代，时间复杂度为$O(n^2)$。","text_html":"<h3>解释</h3>\n<p>这是最耗时且也最直观的算法。遍历整个列表，对于列表中的每个数字，检查是否有另一个数字相加和为给定的数字<code>n</code>。</p>\n<p>因此，使用嵌套的<code>for</code>循环，对整个列表中的每个数字进行遍历迭代。</p>\n<h3>时间复杂度</h3>\n<p>由于在整个<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.43056em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.43056em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span></span></span></span>元素的列表上进行了嵌套迭代，时间复杂度为<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141079999999999em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1.064108em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:-0.363em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>。</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":2},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"7f70f811-ba2c-4397-a609-bf5ac3b94d3d","text":"## 解法2：排序+二分","text_html":"<h2>解法2：排序+二分</h2>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":3},{"type":"TabbedCode","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"66a2a2fd-367f-44e6-86d6-229ad9a142d3","caption":"","code_contents":[{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"tab_code_0_66a2a2fd-367f-44e6-86d6-229ad9a142d3","title":"find_sum","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"def binary_search(lst, item):\n    \"\"\"\n    Binary Search helper function\n    :param lst: A list of integers\n    :param item: An item to be searched in the list\n    \"\"\"\n\n    first = 0\n    last = len(lst) - 1\n    found = False\n    \n    while first <= last and not found:\n        mid = (first + last) // 2\n        \n        if lst[mid] == item:\n            found = mid\n        else:\n            if item < lst[mid]:\n                last = mid - 1\n            else:\n                first = mid + 1\n    \n    return found\n\n\ndef find_sum(lst, n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Function to find two number that add up to n\n    :param lst: A list of integers\n    :param n: The integer number n\n    \"\"\"\n\n    lst.sort()\n\n    for j in lst:\n        index = binary_search(lst, n - j)\n        if index:\n            return [j, n - j]\n\n\n# Driver to test above code\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    \n    print(find_sum([1, 2, 3, 4], 5))\n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null}],"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":4},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"5f3e1a83-cd68-4626-a7fa-6db7bddf4705","text":"### 解释\n\n虽然解法1非常直观，但时间效率并不高。一个更好的思路是首先对列表进行排序。然后，对于列表中的每个数字，使用二分搜索来寻找该数字与预期的总和之间的差异。\n\n因此，如果预期的总和是**n**，而排序列表的某个数字是**a**，那么将对**n-a**进行二分搜索。依次对排序后列表中的每个数字进行查找，直到找到匹配的数字。\n\n### 时间复杂度\n\n由于大多数的排序函数复杂度为$O(nlogn)$，假设使用 Python内置的`.sort()`对列表进行排序。 然后，对每个数字的二分搜索需要$O(logn)$，因此对所有 $n$ 个数字的二分搜索将需要 $O(nlogn)$。 故，总的时间复杂度是 $O(nlogn)$。","text_html":"<h3>解释</h3>\n<p>虽然解法1非常直观，但时间效率并不高。一个更好的思路是首先对列表进行排序。然后，对于列表中的每个数字，使用二分搜索来寻找该数字与预期的总和之间的差异。</p>\n<p>因此，如果预期的总和是<strong>n</strong>，而排序列表的某个数字是<strong>a</strong>，那么将对<strong>n-a</strong>进行二分搜索。依次对排序后列表中的每个数字进行查找，直到找到匹配的数字。</p>\n<h3>时间复杂度</h3>\n<p>由于大多数的排序函数复杂度为<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(nlogn)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>，假设使用 Python内置的<code>.sort()</code>对列表进行排序。 然后，对每个数字的二分搜索需要<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(logn)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>，因此对所有 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.43056em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.43056em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span></span></span></span> 个数字的二分搜索将需要 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(nlogn)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>。 故，总的时间复杂度是 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(nlogn)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>。</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":5},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"2dc4a5ae-7fe6-4315-8a7b-02e23abc0db9","text":"## 解法3: 使用字典`dict`","text_html":"<h2>解法3: 使用字典<code>dict</code></h2>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":6},{"type":"TabbedCode","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a2ae48a8-e99c-4bc4-bd16-a4d9825324f8","caption":"","code_contents":[{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"tab_code_0_a2ae48a8-e99c-4bc4-bd16-a4d9825324f8","title":"find_sum","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"def find_sum(lst, n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Function to find two number that add up to n\n    :param lst: A list of integers\n    :param n: The integer number n\n    \"\"\"\n\n    found_values = {}\n\n    for ele in lst:\n        try:\n            found_values[n - ele]\n            return [n - ele, ele]\n        except:\n            found_values[ele] = 0\n\n    return False\n\n\n# Driver to test above code\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n\n    print(find_sum([1, 3, 2, 4], 6))\n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null}],"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":7},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"8973b913-db0b-4fe0-b9b4-de907490d7ed","text":"### 解释\n\n解决此问题最好的方法：将每个数字插入一个字典（或哈希表）。这需要$O(n)$作为插入的恒定时间。\n\n首先检查字典，如果没有找到差值$sum-element$，那么，在字典中插入这个数字。所以，对于列表中的每一个数字$x$，都可以查找它的目标匹配数字$T-x$，如果找到了，就返回$T-x$和$x$。这里，$T$是和，$x$是列表中的一个数字。如果字典里有$T$和$x$的差值，那么，就意味着这两个数字已经找到了。\n\n### 时间复杂度\n\n每次查找都是一个恒定的时间操作。\n\n总的来说，运行时间是$O(n)$。\n\n注意，因为使用了字典，所以空间复杂度的是$O(n)$。\n\n\n## 解法4：使用集合`set`","text_html":"<h3>解释</h3>\n<p>解决此问题最好的方法：将每个数字插入一个字典（或哈希表）。这需要<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>作为插入的恒定时间。</p>\n<p>首先检查字典，如果没有找到差值<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">sum-element</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.69444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.77777em;vertical-align:-0.08333em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">t</span></span></span></span>，那么，在字典中插入这个数字。所以，对于列表中的每一个数字<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.43056em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.43056em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">x</span></span></span></span>，都可以查找它的目标匹配数字<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T-x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.68333em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.76666em;vertical-align:-0.08333em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">T</span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">x</span></span></span></span>，如果找到了，就返回<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T-x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.68333em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.76666em;vertical-align:-0.08333em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">T</span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">x</span></span></span></span>和<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.43056em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.43056em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">x</span></span></span></span>。这里，<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.68333em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.68333em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">T</span></span></span></span>是和，<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.43056em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.43056em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">x</span></span></span></span>是列表中的一个数字。如果字典里有<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.68333em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.68333em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">T</span></span></span></span>和<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.43056em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.43056em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">x</span></span></span></span>的差值，那么，就意味着这两个数字已经找到了。</p>\n<h3>时间复杂度</h3>\n<p>每次查找都是一个恒定的时间操作。</p>\n<p>总的来说，运行时间是<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>注意，因为使用了字典，所以空间复杂度的是<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h2>解法4：使用集合<code>set</code></h2>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":8},{"type":"TabbedCode","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"33471002-8479-4a42-bcf4-cae07e35df77","caption":"","code_contents":[{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"tab_code_0_33471002-8479-4a42-bcf4-cae07e35df77","title":"find_sum","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"def find_sum(lst, n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Function to find two number that add up to n\n    :param lst: A list of integers\n    :param n: The integer number n\n    \"\"\"\n\n    found_values = set()\n\n    for ele in lst:\n        if n - ele in found_values:\n            return [n - ele, ele]\n        found_values.add(ele)\n\n    return False\n\n\n# Driver to test above code\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n  \n  print(find_sum([1, 3, 2, 4], 6))","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null}],"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":9},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"3e9804c0-d9ef-4dfb-a32b-ad5ecbc189df","text":"### 解释\n\n解法4本质思想和解法3相同，只是它使用了Python的内置`set()`来存储数字。\n\n### 时间复杂度\n\n和解法3类似，时间复杂度为$O(n)$。\n\n但空间复杂度也是$O(n)$。\n\n---","text_html":"<h3>解释</h3>\n<p>解法4本质思想和解法3相同，只是它使用了Python的内置<code>set()</code>来存储数字。</p>\n<h3>时间复杂度</h3>\n<p>和解法3类似，时间复杂度为<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>但空间复杂度也是<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<hr />\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":10}],"status":"undo","course_no":"010","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/010/page/438"}
